ACIR 3.0

bench DCBench for SingleEndedAmp
  builtin SEAmpDCBench
  outputs:
    OutputDCBias
    QuiescentPower

circuit InvalidAutoSweep implements SingleEndedAmp
  level EL
  supply VDD
  ground GND
  port IN : analog
  port OUT : analog
  fill:
    nmos M_in (D->OUT, G->IN, S->GND, B->GND) : size=(W=10u, L=180n, M=1) nmos
  harness:
    supply VDD = 1.8V
    sweep InputDCBias [Auto]
    load OUT C=1pF
